{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Calibri;}}\fs22  Profile Photo Requirements for Clients\line \line  Why a Proper Profile Photo is Required\line \line At US Capital Private Bank, your profile photo is more than just an image  it is an essential part of your identity verification and security. Without a proper, professional photo, you may face challenges when accessing your account or visiting one of our many branches.\line \line  Security & Branch Access\line \line -\line Our security staff verifies your photo upon arrival at any of our branches.\line \line -\line If the image on your profile does not match your real appearance, you may be delayed or denied entry.\line \line -\line \line  Transaction & Identity Verification\line \line -\line A clear, accurate image helps our officers confirm your identity quickly.\line \line -\line This ensures faster processing of in-branch services and account support.\line \line -\line \line  Loan & Credit Considerations\line \line -\line Presentation matters in banking.\line \line -\line A professional photo reflects credibility and may positively influence lending decisions, credit approvals, and other account-related opportunities.\line \line -\line \line  Global Branch Recognition\line \line -\line We serve clients worldwide.\line \line -\line An updated professional photo ensures seamless recognition and service at any of our branches.\line \line -\line \line  Benefits of Updating Your Photo\line \line -\line Faster and smoother account access.\line \line -\line Improved security for your transactions.\line \line -\line Professional presentation for credit and loan evaluations.\line \line -\line Hassle-free recognition across all our global branches.\line \line -\line \line  What Makes a Proper Profile Photo?\line \line -\line Clear and recent image of your face.\line \line -\line Neutral or professional background.\line \line -\line Business or professional attire recommended.\line \line -\line No sunglasses, hats, or obstructions.\line \line  Need Help?\line \line Our support team is available to guide you through updating your profile photo:\line \line -\line Email: customerservice@uscapitalprivatebank.com\line \line -\line Website: https://uscapitalprivatebank.com\line \line Thank you,\line US Capital Private Bank Client Relations}